  "referenceNumber": "RUS1467",
  "remarks": "\nVladimir GUNDYAYEV, known as Patriarch Kirill, is the head of the Russian Orthodox Church. Patriarch Kirill has made multiple public statements in support of the Russian invasion of Ukraine. He therefore engages in, provides support for, or promotes any policy or action which destabilises Ukraine or undermines or threatens the territorial integrity, sovereignty or independence of Ukraine.\n The trust services sanctions were imposed on 21/03/2023.",
